{"id":"66b3ab8406681395","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-compositional-truth.md","title":"无真理语言归纳的组合真理CT减","display":"df-compositional-truth — 无真理语言归纳的组合真理CT减","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-compositional-truth","aliases":["91-df-compositional-truth"],"display":"df-compositional-truth — 无真理语言归纳的组合真理CT减","depends_on":["[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-compositional-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-compositional-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-compositional-truth — 无真理语言归纳的组合真理CT减"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" href=\"?note=b0b2a8b496dd82c3\" title=\"91-df-compositional-axioms\">91-df-compositional-axioms</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-compositional-truth-—-组合真理理论-$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$\">df-compositional-truth — 组合真理理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (在扩展语言中表述但仅含 PA 公理的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\)</span> (基础语言的组合真理公理)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> (经典一阶逻辑的演绎闭包)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\bigr),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\bigr),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上标 “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-\">\\(-\\)</span>” 表示没有把含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 公式的归纳模式加入理论。\n组合公理统一说明真理如何穿过基础语言的原子式、联结词和量词；\n它们不等于对含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的任意句子加入全透明双条件。</p>\n<p>标准的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 对 PA 算术保守。它在扩展语言中比 TB\n拥有更多统一的真理定理，但这不意味着有更多纯算术定理。\n含完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 归纳的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a> 另行定义，\n且不是 PA 的算术保守扩张。故必须同时标明是否有上标 “<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-\">\\(-\\)</span>” 和采用哪种\n归纳；本节点只引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span>，不重复定义完整 CT。</p>\n<p>一致性也须相对表述：由 PA 保守性可在元理论中得到相应相对一致性，\n不能写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})\\)</span>，\n否则由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 包含 PA 会违反第二不完备定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-compositional-truth-—-组合真理理论-$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$","text":"df-compositional-truth — 组合真理理论 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-compositional-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"b0b2a8b496dd82c3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"标准的 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ 对 PA 算术保守。它在扩展语言中比 TB\n拥有更多统一的真理定理，但这不意味着有更多纯算术定理。\n含完整 $\\mathcal L_T$ 归纳的 $\\mathrm{CT}$ 由 [[91-df-CT]] 另行定义，\n且不是 PA 的算术保守扩张。故必须同时标明是否有上标 “$-$” 和采用哪种\n归纳；本节点只引入 $\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$，不重复定义完整 CT。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}compositional\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\n\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\bigr),","display":true},{"tex":"-","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"-","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathrm{CT}^{-})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CT}^{-}$ (不含扩展语言归纳的组合真理理论, see [[91-df-compositional-truth]])"},{"id":"f744fc361db0ee96","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-compositional-truth]]"},{"id":"e